            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Intention now speaks 简体中文. Settings › General › Language switches the whole interface on the
  spot; it follows your Mac's language until you choose otherwise.
- ← and → now move along the quick duration chips when choosing how long you need, alongside Tab.
]]></description>
